o understand inventory and stock related things when I was working at our family business', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '374389783955', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reading (sometime)\r\nChess (learner)\r\nBusiness understanding (Ecommerce, food related)\r\nWriting AI - content design', 'Computer efficiency \r\nMS-Office( Excel, word , ppt)\r\nCanva design\r\nSeller portals\r\nMis reporting \r\nGoogle sheet\r\nMaking SOP\r\nAI tools\r\nDocumentation Reporting \r\nInvoicing', NULL, 'As in my knowledge I\'m fit and fine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
